@startuml SD-12 Offline Node Detection
title SD-12 Offline Node Detection

participant "Offline Monitor Task" as Task
database "Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS
participant "Registration App" as RegApp
participant "Monitor App" as MonApp

Task -> DB: Find nodes with expired heartbeat
DB --> Task: Offline candidates
Task -> DB: Set node status = OFFLINE
DB --> Task: Commit success
Task -> WS: Broadcast node_offline
WS -> RegApp: Show node offline
WS -> MonApp: Show node offline alert

@enduml